flowchart TB
  H["Other harness or MCP client"]
  S["Native stdio bridge"]
  T["Opt-in loopback Streamable HTTP"]
  H --> S
  H --> T
  S --> A["Authenticate registered external client<br/>current scopes and selected operations"]
  T --> A
  A --> M["McpServerAdapter<br/>versioned tools, resources and prompts"]
  M --> G["Shared application gateway<br/>authority, revisions, attribution and receipts"]
  U["Native UI and DevWorks agent tools"] --> G
  G --> C["Indexed code<br/>architecture, source and citations"]
  G --> W["Planned work<br/>plans, tasks, blockers and history"]
  G --> K["Knowledge<br/>claims, evidence and documents"]
  G --> P["Existing command policies<br/>explicit grants; human-only holds retained"]
  C --> R["Bounded authorized result<br/>view, coverage and freshness<br/>recheck revocation before publication"]
  W --> R
  K --> R
  P --> R
  R --> H
  L["Desktop lifetime owns serving<br/>close stops both bindings<br/>no daemon or second store writer"] -.-> M
